  annotation(Documentation(info="<html><h2>必要方程核心包</h2><p><b>类路径：</b><code>OneSatSim.Foundation.Models</code>　<b>类型：</b>package</p><h3>用途与定位</h3><p>必要方程核心包</p><h3>阅读与调用</h3><p>本包用于组织类。按下表进入相应模型；包本身不单独启动仿真。</p><table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"5\"><tr><th>类</th><th>用途</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.AOCSControlComputation\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.AOCSControlComputation</a></td><td>低阶双矢量姿态控制核心</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.AverageDCDCConverterCore\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.AverageDCDCConverterCore</a></td><td>连续低阶非理想直流变换核心</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.BatteryCellLimits\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.BatteryCellLimits</a></td><td>电芯参数与荷电状态边界</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.BatteryCellStackCore\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.BatteryCellStackCore</a></td><td>带公开荷电状态接口的电池组</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.CommandAdapter\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.CommandAdapter</a></td><td>任务接口到设备指令与状态的纯映射</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.CommandArbiter\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.CommandArbiter</a></td><td>任务请求的单入口事件锁存仲裁器</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.DownlinkSequencer\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.DownlinkSequencer</a></td><td>请求驱动的下行动作时序器</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.EngineeringTelemetryObserver\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.EngineeringTelemetryObserver</a></td><td>整星信息总线的只读工程遥测观察器</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.EphemerisDataAdapter\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.EphemerisDataAdapter</a></td><td>星历表信号与导数一致适配</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.EphemerisEnvironmentReader\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.EphemerisEnvironmentReader</a></td><td>固化星历表读取装配</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.EquivalentAOCSCore\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.EquivalentAOCSCore</a></td><td>低阶双矢量姿态控制核心</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.ImagingSequencer\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.ImagingSequencer</a></td><td>请求驱动的成像动作时序器</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionActionRequestMailbox\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionActionRequestMailbox</a></td><td>任务动作请求事件邮箱</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionActionResultMailbox\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionActionResultMailbox</a></td><td>任务动作结果事件邮箱</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionFeedbackAdapter\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionFeedbackAdapter</a></td><td>物理状态到任务反馈的选择适配器</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionGeometryEventMailbox\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionGeometryEventMailbox</a></td><td>活动目标几何事件邮箱</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionOpportunityGenerator\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionOpportunityGenerator</a></td><td>原始机会与活动对象几何生成器</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionPlanner\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionPlanner</a></td><td>对象感知的任务规划器</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionStateMachine\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionStateMachine</a></td><td>单向动作握手的事件驱动任务状态机</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.OrbitalGeometry\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.OrbitalGeometry</a></td><td>真实历元轨道、多地面站与多目标环境核心</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.SafeModeSequencer\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.SafeModeSequencer</a></td><td>请求驱动的安全进入、保持与恢复时序器</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.SafetyMonitor\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.SafetyMonitor</a></td><td>带回差的任务安全许可监视器</td></tr></table></html>"),
